{"instructions":"The other driver's insurer has contacted us regarding Farah Pemberton's auto accident claim. Please pull up Farah Pemberton's auto claim file and provide the full details needed for responding to the other driver's insurer: policy/claim number, insured name, date and description of the accident, vehicle and driver details, damage description, liability determination/reservation of rights status, and any documents we have on file (police report, photos, estimates, correspondence).

